1. Introduction 
AI Weather Wise is a web-based weather information application.
It provides current weather conditions and a 7-day forecast. 
Users can search by city or use browser-based location access. 
A smart recommendation module converts weather values into practical advice. 
The application is designed for simple, fast and user-friendly access.
2. Problem Statement Users often need quick and understandable weather information.
Raw weather values may not directly tell users what action to take. Important details such as rainfall, heat, wind and humidity can be difficult to interpret quickly. 
The project addresses this by combining live weather data with simple smart recommendations.
3. Objectives Develop a responsive and easy-to-use weather website.
Retrieve live weather information through an API.
Display temperature, humidity, rainfall, wind speed and cloud cover. 
Provide a 7-day forecast. 
Support city search and current-location weather.
Generate useful weather advice using rule-based analysis.
4. Existing vs Proposed System Existing System: 
• Weather applications may present large amounts of information. 
• Users may need to interpret several weather values themselves.
Proposed System: 
• Simple dashboard with important weather values. 
• 7-day forecast and location support. 
• Smart advice based on current weather conditions.
5. Technologies Used HTML5 page structure and user interface.
CSS3 responsive layout, cards, buttons and visual design. 
JavaScript API communication, data processing and dynamic updates. 
Open-Meteo Geocoding API converts city names into coordinates. 
Open-Meteo Forecast API provides current and daily forecast data. 
Browser Geolocation API obtains user location after permission.
