Main Modules City Search Module finds a location from a city name.
Weather Data Module retrieves live weather information. 
Current Weather Module displays temperature and conditions.
Forecast Module generates the 7-day forecast. 
Smart Recommendation Module analyzes weather conditions. 
Location Module supports weather lookup using browser location.
8. Smart Recommendation Logic Thunderstorm → recommends staying indoors and taking caution.
Heavy rainfall → suggests carrying an umbrella and allowing extra travel time. 
Rain → suggests carrying an umbrella. High temperature → recommends hydration and avoiding prolonged sunlight.
Low temperature → suggests an extra layer. Strong wind → recommends caution in exposed areas. 
High humidity → recommends hydration.
9. Working Process 
1. User enters a city name or selects My Location.
2. The application obtains geographical coordinates. 
3. Coordinates are sent to the weather API.
4. Weather data is returned in JSON format.
5. JavaScript processes the data.
6. Current conditions and 7-day forecast are displayed.
7. Smart recommendation logic generates practical advice.
